+rationale = "Copied and zero-copy host writes invalidate physical code dependencies before bytes can change. Zero-copy admission authenticates the exact selected host pointer and retains every destination through the host call, including partial failure and unwind. The current-MM read projection stays scalar. These byte-write observations do not authorize native execution."
